    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d126">

                <pb facs="0221" n="205" xml:id="pg205"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">501.A Summaries/11–1049: Telegram</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">The United State Representative at the United
                        Nations</hi> (<hi rendition="#italic"
                        >Austin</hi>) <hi rendition="#italic">to the Acting Secretary of State
                    </hi>
                </head>
                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Extract]</seg></opener>
                <opener>
                    <seg rendition="#float-left">
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">secret</hi>
                    </seg>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">New York</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1949-11-10T00:25:00-05:00">November 10,
                            1949—12:25 a. m.</date>
                    </dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>1328.</p>
                <p>. . . . . . .</p>
                <p rendition="#center">
                    <hi rendition="#small-caps">Chinese Question</hi>
                </p>
                <p>In response to a query, Tsiang (China) said he had not mentioned to any other
                    delegation the fact that he did not intend to introduce a resolution concerning
                    the Sino-Soviet Treaty case and would not so mention it. When he was informed
                    the US had not yet reached a firm decision to submit a resolution on China,
                    Tsiang said he still hoped the US would proceed with a broadly-based resolution
                    at the proper time.</p>
                <p>. . . . . . .</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">Austin</hi>
                    </signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
